[{"type":"message","user":"U01DE459A02","text":"\u003c@U01DE459A02\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628950438.443000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"13876bd3-6ba0-487c-bb99-d70f9e2e5100","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"再加熱はしろよ、くらい?","ts":"1628930589.442700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pYuP2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CF8BE913-98A2-4D25-AC05-B255C7D98732","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ほぼ:thinking_face: ","ts":"1628930051.441500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"151"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8D28E731-963B-4A8B-A42A-E6416B59FA73","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gigazine/status/1426461148254248961?s=21|https://twitter.com/gigazine/status/1426461148254248961?s=21\u003e","ts":"1628930036.441000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gigazine|@gigazine\u003e: 南極で100年以上前の「ほぼ食べられる」フルーツケーキ見つかる(2017)\n\u003chttp://gigazine.net/news/20170814-|gigazine.net/news/20170814-\u003e…","id":1,"author_name":"GIGAZINE(ギガジン)","author_subname":"@gigazine","author_link":"https://twitter.com/gigazine/status/1426461148254248961","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/876998955627827204/IuoxMaM2_normal.jpg","text":"南極で100年以上前の「ほぼ食べられる」フルーツケーキ見つかる(2017)\n\u003chttp://gigazine.net/news/20170814-|gigazine.net/news/20170814-\u003e…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628929814,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/gigazine/status/1426461148254248961?s=21","original_url":"https://twitter.com/gigazine/status/1426461148254248961?s=21"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5neV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85b230c9-d5e1-4cb9-808a-b89d8ae254fa","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"心配しすぎも体に毒ですしね。","ts":"1628909463.440500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1LUMF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cace122e-41bc-4e0f-b60d-9aa3d7432dd6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"別症状や38℃超えなくても37.5℃超えが日をまたぐようなら考えたほうが良い。","ts":"1628909383.440100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VI=o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f60f1fe-d979-4aa6-beea-03a344c9519d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"鼻水とか喉の痛みとか息苦しさとか、そういうのが無いのなら、38℃超えるくらいまでは特段問題ない。","ts":"1628909332.439200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1eMFM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"870535c0-a783-4673-8aff-b28d1c004807","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"普段から計って自分の平熱を把握しておくのが大事なのかなという気がします。","ts":"1628909298.438600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["U022PB40WAF","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HPI3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38f01841-560c-46d5-a2ef-01e5b99bce38","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ちなみに私は平常時に体温を測るとだいたいいつも 36.8℃ になるので、それを目安にしてます。","ts":"1628909269.437800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oIn/s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"084e5c65-3a24-4b6f-b29b-3acd3aed929d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"他に症状がなければ、気にしなくてよいと思うよ。","ts":"1628909267.437700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yr7Am"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29597d46-6ac9-4198-a298-518f68224df3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"今のところ、夕方（食前）で測った時に37.5℃以上を指していた場合は発熱を疑った方がいいという感じですかね。","ts":"1628909184.436900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kDgj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5a34a22-dae8-403b-93f3-31523eb442af","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや2かな?","ts":"1628908952.434900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"amj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6086ac3-2fdd-4ba5-b7b7-2bec3bed5eeb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"さっきのグラフの+3σくらいになってそうだ","ts":"1628908938.434700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mA9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ebe1fb5-7c5e-4991-8eff-7d490334cb8b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああ、感染症法か。","ts":"1628908869.434100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VigA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1e8acc1-26d6-4ad6-8e2e-fb51728a607f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あと、37.5℃が法律で決められていたボーダーラインだとは知りませんでした。そりゃ法てそうなっていれば皆それに合わせるよねと。","ts":"1628908832.433700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eC2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbe2c7fa-efee-4d9d-9df0-3ae1e71e284a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なるほど。中央がほぼ37.0の正規分布っぽいな。たしかにこれなら37.0超えたら打つのやめとこって考える医師がいても不思議はない。","ts":"1628908735.432700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5VL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cd9b1eb-2098-4a26-bff4-6cc2ec867716","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"テルモがこんな記事を出していたので投げておきます。\n\u003chttps://www.terumo-taion.jp/terumo/report/03_2.html\u003e","ts":"1628908296.431600","attachments":[{"fallback":"発見！体温を正しく測れている人は少ない？ 結果詳細・ドクター解説｜活動報告｜テルモ体温研究所とは｜テルモ体温研究所","id":1,"title":"発見！体温を正しく測れている人は少ない？ 結果詳細・ドクター解説｜活動報告｜テルモ体温研究所とは｜テルモ体温研究所","title_link":"https://www.terumo-taion.jp/terumo/report/03_2.html","text":"テルモ体温研究所は体温をキーワードに新しい健康生活を提案していきます","blocks":null,"service_name":"terumo-taion.jp","service_icon":"https://www.terumo-taion.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.terumo-taion.jp/terumo/report/03_2.html","original_url":"https://www.terumo-taion.jp/terumo/report/03_2.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9Wg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aea4dad-b372-443e-ba81-5a7be5d5502c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もちろん他のリスクも勘案してなんだろうけど、そういう体温ってことです。","ts":"1628906368.431200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c=bY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4766117-48bc-4e01-983c-0af7d80fd5dc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"37.0℃ってのは、インフルエンザの予防接種を取りやめられる場合がある。","ts":"1628906341.430800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D1p"}]}]
